    new "Não acredito que ela fez isso com o parceiro dela. Que nojo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2762
    old "She has someone who loves her and she does THAT behind their back?"
    new "Ela tem alguém que a ama e faz AQUILO pelas costas?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2762
    old "I would never do that to someone I'm with. What she did is unforgivable."
    new "Eu nunca faria isso com alguém com quem estou. O que ela fez é imperdoável."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2768
    old "And you just went along with it. Doesn't that bother you at all?"
    new "E você simplesmente foi junto. Isso não te incomoda nem um pouco?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2768
    old "Her partner deserves to know."
    new "O parceiro dela merece saber."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2768
    old "I hope you know what kind of person she really is."
    new "Espero que saiba que tipo de pessoa ela realmente é."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2775
    old "So she's got a partner and she's with you? Smart girl."
    new "Então ela tem um parceiro e está com você? Garota esperta."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2775
    old "Honestly? Her partner probably isn't giving her what she needs."
    new "Sinceramente? O parceiro dela provavelmente não dá o que ela precisa."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2775
    old "I'm not one to judge. People have needs."
    new "Não sou de julgar. As pessoas têm necessidades."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2781
    old "Just be careful. If her partner finds out, it won't be pretty."
    new "Só tome cuidado. Se o parceiro dela descobrir, não vai ser bonito."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2781
    old "Maybe she and I have more in common than I thought."
    new "Talvez ela é eu tenhamos mais em comum do que eu pensava."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2781
    old "As long as nobody gets caught, what's the harm?"
    new "Enquanto ninguém for pego, qual o problema?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2788
    old "Wait, she has a partner? And you two were... oh my god."
    new "Espera, ela tem um parceiro? E vocês dois estavam... meu Deus."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2788
    old "That's so wrong. Her poor partner has no idea..."
    new "Isso é tão errado. O pobre parceiro dela não faz ideia..."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2788
    old "I feel bad just knowing about it. Should I say something?"
    new "Me sinto mal só de saber disso. Devo falar algo?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2794
    old "I don't want to get involved, but it feels wrong to stay quiet."
    new "Não quero me envolver, mas parece errado ficar quieta."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2794
    old "Promise me you'd never do that to someone who trusts you."
    new "Me promete que nunca faria isso com alguém que confia em você."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2794
    old "I couldn't live with that kind of guilt..."
    new "Eu não conseguiria viver com esse tipo de culpa..."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2801
    old "The fact that she did it where someone could see... that takes nerve."
    new "O fato de ela ter feito onde alguém poderia ver... isso é muita coragem."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2801
    old "I won't lie, there's something thrilling about the risk of getting caught."
    new "Não vou mentir, tem algo emocionante no risco de ser pego."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2801
    old "Her partner would lose it if they knew. And honestly, that's kind of exciting."
    new "O parceiro dela ia surtar se soubesse. E sinceramente, isso é meio excitante."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2807
    old "Not saying I approve. Just saying I understand the rush."
    new "Não estou dizendo que aprovo. Só digo que entendo a adrenalina."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2807
    old "The danger makes it hotter, doesn't it? Don't look at me like that."
    new "O perigo torna tudo mais quente, né? Não me olhe assim."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2813
    old "So I saw you with her the other day. Does her partner know?"
    new "Então te vi com ela outro dia. O parceiro dela sabe?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2813
    old "She's got a partner and she's sneaking around with you? Yikes."
    new "Ela tem um parceiro e fica se escondendo com você? Tenso."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2813
    old "I'm not going to tell anyone, but... that's messy."
    new "Não vou contar pra ninguém, mas... isso é complicado."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2819
    old "Just be careful. These things always come out eventually."
    new "Só tome cuidado. Essas coisas sempre aparecem no final."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2819
    old "I'm staying out of it, but don't drag me into your drama."
    new "Vou ficar de fora, mas não me arrasta pro seu drama."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2819
    old "None of my business, I guess. But still... wow."
    new "Não é da minha conta, eu acho. Mas mesmo assim... uau."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2835
    old "You cheated on me with a girl who's ALSO cheating on her partner? You're both terrible."
    new "Você me traiu com uma garota que TAMBÉM está traindo o parceiro dela? Vocês dois são péssimos."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2835
    old "So neither of you has any loyalty. Great. That makes me feel SO much better."
    new "Então nenhum dos dois tem lealdade. Ótimo. Isso me faz sentir MUITO melhor."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2835
    old "I was the only one being faithful in any of this. What a joke."
    new "Eu era a única sendo fiel em tudo isso. Que piada."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2841
    old "I feel like an idiot for trusting either of you."
    new "Me sinto uma idiota por ter confiado em qualquer um de vocês."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2841
    old "Two cheaters found each other. I should have seen it coming."
    new "Dois traidores se encontraram. Eu deveria ter visto isso chegando."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2841
    old "At least I know now. I won't make that mistake again."
    new "Pelo menos agora eu sei. Não vou cometer esse erro de novo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2848
    old "You and her deserve each other. Two backstabbers in one room."
    new "Vocês se merecem. Dois traidores na mesma sala."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2848
    old "You couldn't even cheat with someone single? Real classy."
    new "Nem conseguiu trair com alguém solteiro? Muita classe."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2848
    old "Her partner and I both got screwed over. Not the fun kind either."
    new "O parceiro dela é eu fomos os dois sacaneados. E não do tipo divertido."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2854
    old "I'm done being angry about it. But I'm NEVER forgetting it."
    new "Cansei de ficar com raiva disso. Mas NUNCA vou esquecer."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2854
    old "Next time, don't make promises you can't keep."
    new "Da próxima vez, não faça promessas que não pode cumprir."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2860
    old "You cheated on me, and she's cheating on her partner. What a mess."
    new "Você me traiu, e ela está traindo o parceiro dela. Que bagunça."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2860
    old "So I walked in on two people who don't care about anyone but themselves."
    new "Então eu flagrei duas pessoas que não se importam com ninguém além de si mesmas."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2860
    old "Her partner doesn't know, I didn't know. Real nice."
    new "O parceiro dela não sabe, eu não sabia. Muito bonito."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2866
    old "I just keep asking myself why. Why wasn't I enough?"
    new "Só fico me perguntando por quê. Por que eu não era suficiente?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2866
    old "I hope it was worth it. For both of you."
    new "Espero que tenha valido a pena. Pros dois."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2866
    old "I don't even know who to be more angry at. You or her."
    new "Nem sei com quem ter mais raiva. Você ou ela."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2882
    old "I still think about seeing you two out in the open like that. It was... exciting."
    new "Ainda penso em ter visto vocês dois assim ao ar livre. Foi... excitante."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2882
    old "You really went for it in public. That takes courage. Or insanity."
    new "Você realmente foi fundo em público. Isso requer coragem. Ou loucura."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2882
    old "The fact that anyone could have walked by and seen you two... my heart was racing."
    new "O fato de qualquer um poder ter passado e visto vocês dois... meu coração estava disparado."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2888
    old "If that ever happens again, maybe give me a heads up first. I might want a better view."
    new "Se isso acontecer de novo, talvez me avise antes. Posso querer uma vista melhor."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2888
    old "I won't lie, I've been thinking about what I saw more than I should."
    new "Não vou mentir, tenho pensado no que vi mais do que deveria."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2888
    old "You know, I wouldn't mind being in that situation myself someday."
    new "Sabe, eu não me importaria de estar nessa situação um dia."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2896
    old "I can't believe you did that where ANYONE could see! What is wrong with you?!"
    new "Não acredito que você fez aquilo onde QUALQUER UM podia ver! O que há de errado com você?!"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2896
    old "Do you have any idea how embarrassing it was to walk in on that?"
    new "Você tem ideia de como foi constrangedor flagrar aquilo?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2896
    old "I still get red just thinking about it. In PUBLIC? Really?"
    new "Ainda fico vermelha só de pensar nisso. Em PÚBLICO? Sério?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2902
    old "If someone else had seen... I don't even want to think about it."
    new "Se outra pessoa tivesse visto... nem quero pensar nisso."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2902
    old "Please, for the love of everything, get a room next time."
    new "Por favor, pelo amor de tudo, arruma um quarto da próxima vez."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2902
    old "I'm traumatized. Genuinely traumatized."
    new "Estou traumatizada. Genuinamente traumatizada."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2910
    old "I couldn't look away when I saw you two. I know I should have, but..."
    new "Não consegui desviar o olhar quando vi vocês dois. Eu sei que deveria, mas..."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2910
    old "You were right there, out in the open. I watched longer than I should admit."
    new "Vocês estavam ali, ao ar livre. Fiquei olhando mais do que deveria admitir."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2910
    old "The thrill of watching you without you knowing... I'm not proud of it."
    new "A emoção de assistir vocês sem saberem... não me orgulho disso."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2916
    old "Don't tell anyone I said that. I have a reputation to maintain."
    new "Não conta pra ninguém que eu disse isso. Tenho uma reputação a manter."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2916
    old "I know it's weird. But I couldn't help myself."
    new "Eu sei que é estranho. Mas não consegui me controlar."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2916
    old "Next time... maybe don't be so careless. Or do. Your call."
    new "Da próxima vez... talvez não seja tão descuidado. Ou seja. Você decide."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2924
    old "You know I saw you two outside, right? You weren't exactly subtle."
    new "Sabe que eu vi vocês dois lá fora, né? Vocês não foram exatamente discretos."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2924
    old "Anyone could have seen what you were doing. Were you trying to get caught?"
    new "Qualquer um poderia ter visto o que vocês estavam fazendo. Estavam tentando ser pegos?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2924
    old "Doing that out in the open... do you just not care who sees?"
    new "Fazer aquilo ao ar livre... você simplesmente não se importa com quem vê?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2930
    old "I'm not judging. Okay, maybe a little. But seriously, be more careful."
    new "Não estou julgando. Ok, talvez um pouco. Mas sério, tome mais cuidado."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2930
    old "Just keep it behind closed doors next time, alright?"
    new "Só mantenha isso a portas fechadas da próxima vez, ok?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2930
    old "I'll pretend I didn't see anything. You're welcome."
    new "Vou fingir que não vi nada. De nada."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2945
    old "At the pool? With people potentially around? You've got serious nerve."
    new "Na piscina? Com gente possivelmente por perto? Você tem muita coragem."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2945
    old "The pool, of all places... the water, the swimsuits... it was like a scene from a movie."
    new "A piscina, logo a piscina... a água, os biquínis... parecia uma cena de filme."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2945
    old "I still think about what I saw by the pool. The wet skin, the heat... wow."
    new "Ainda penso no que vi na piscina. A pele molhada, o calor... uau."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2951
    old "Maybe we should go swimming together sometime. See what happens."
    new "Talvez a gente devesse nadar juntos algum dia. Ver o que acontece."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2951
    old "The pool is never going to feel the same after what I saw."
    new "A piscina nunca mais vai ser a mesma depois do que eu vi."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2958
    old "The pool?! Someone could have been swimming right there!"
    new "A piscina?! Alguém poderia estar nadando ali!"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2958
    old "I went to the pool to relax and instead I saw... THAT."
    new "Fui pra piscina relaxar e em vez disso vi... AQUILO."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2958
    old "I can never go back to the pool without thinking about what I saw..."
    new "Nunca mais posso voltar pra piscina sem pensar no que eu vi..."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2964
    old "It was so embarrassing. I almost tripped running away."
    new "Foi tão constrangedor. Quase tropecei fugindo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2964
    old "Please tell me that was a one-time thing..."
    new "Por favor, me diz que foi coisa de uma vez só..."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2971
    old "The pool? Seriously? That's bold even by your standards."
    new "A piscina? Sério? Isso é ousado até pros seus padrões."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2971
    old "I went for a swim and got a show I didn't ask for."
    new "Fui nadar e ganhei um show que não pedi."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2971
    old "You do know other people use that pool, right?"
    new "Você sabe que outras pessoas usam aquela piscina, né?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2977
    old "I'm trying to forget what I saw, but it's not working."
    new "Estou tentando esquecer o que vi, mas não está funcionando."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2977
    old "Next time, at least check if anyone is coming first."
    new "Da próxima vez, pelo menos confira se alguém está vindo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2977
    old "I'll never look at the pool the same way again."
    new "Nunca mais vou olhar pra piscina do mesmo jeito."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2993
    old "I walked past the showers and heard... things. So I stopped. And listened."
    new "Passei pelos chuveiros e ouvi... coisas. Então parei. E escutei."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2993
    old "The shower steam made everything look so... intense. I couldn't look away."
    new "O vapor do chuveiro fazia tudo parecer tão... intenso. Não consegui desviar o olhar."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2993
    old "I saw more than I should have in those showers. And I don't regret it one bit."
    new "Vi mais do que deveria naqueles chuveiros. E não me arrependo nem um pouco."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2999
    old "The acoustics in there are... really something. Every sound was crystal clear."
    new "A acústica de lá é... algo mesmo. Todo som era cristalino."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2999
    old "If you ever need someone to wash your back, I volunteer."
    new "Se precisar de alguém pra esfregar suas costas, eu me voluntario."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3006
    old "The showers?! Those doors don't even LOCK properly!"
    new "Os chuveiros?! Aquelas portas nem TRANCAM direito!"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3006
    old "I needed to shower and instead I walked into your... performance."
    new "Eu precisava tomar banho e em vez disso entrei na sua... apresentação."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3006
    old "I was SO embarrassed. I dropped my towel and ran."
    new "Fiquei TÃO constrangida. Derrubei a toalha e saí correndo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3012
    old "I couldn't shower for two days because I was too scared to go back."
    new "Não consegui tomar banho por dois dias porque tinha medo de voltar lá."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3012
    old "Lock the door next time! If there even IS a lock!"
    new "Tranca a porta da próxima vez! Se é que TEM tranca!"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3019
    old "The shower, huh? At least you picked somewhere with easy cleanup."
    new "O chuveiro, hein? Pelo menos escolheu um lugar fácil de limpar."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3019
    old "I heard the water running for WAY too long. Now I know why."
    new "Ouvi a água correndo por MUITO tempo. Agora sei por quê."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3019
    old "Showers are practical for that kind of thing. Not judging."
    new "Chuveiros são práticos pra esse tipo de coisa. Sem julgamentos."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3025
    old "Next time, run the water louder. I could hear everything."
    new "Da próxima vez, deixa a água mais forte. Eu ouvia tudo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3025
    old "Just saying... the acoustics in that shower leave nothing to the imagination."
    new "Só dizendo... a acústica daquele chuveiro não deixa nada pra imaginação."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3032
    old "I walked into the showers and got a LOT more than I bargained for."
    new "Entrei nos chuveiros e vi MUITO mais do que esperava."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3032
    old "You were in the shower with her. I saw. End of story."
    new "Vocês estavam no chuveiro juntos. Eu vi. Fim da história."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3032
    old "The shower area is shared, you know. Some of us actually use it to shower."
    new "A área dos chuveiros é compartilhada, sabia. Alguns de nós realmente usam pra tomar banho."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3038
    old "I'm going to need some time before I can shower in peace again."
    new "Vou precisar de um tempo antes de poder tomar banho em paz de novo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3038
    old "At least put a towel on the door handle or something. A warning."
    new "Pelo menos coloca uma toalha na maçaneta ou algo assim. Um aviso."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3038
    old "I'll knock from now on. Trust me."
    new "Vou bater na porta de agora em diante. Confia."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3054
    old "The door was cracked open. I didn't mean to look, but... I did."
    new "A porta estava entreaberta. Não era pra eu olhar, mas... olhei."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3054
    old "I heard noises from your room. I stood outside longer than I should have."
    new "Ouvi barulhos do seu quarto. Fiquei do lado de fora mais tempo do que deveria."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3054
    old "I peeked through the door. I know it's wrong. But I couldn't help it."
    new "Espiei pela porta. Sei que é errado. Mas não consegui evitar."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3060
    old "You should really close your door all the way. Or don't. Up to you."
    new "Você deveria mesmo fechar a porta toda. Ou não. Você decide."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3060
    old "I might have seen everything. I might have seen nothing. You'll never know."
    new "Talvez eu tenha visto tudo. Talvez não tenha visto nada. Você nunca vai saber."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3067
    old "I came to your room to ask you something and... the door was open..."
    new "Fui no seu quarto pra perguntar algo e... a porta estava aberta..."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3067
    old "I didn't mean to see anything! I just knocked and it swung open!"
    new "Não era pra eu ver nada! Só bati e a porta abriu!"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3067
    old "I've been avoiding your hallway since that day. You know why."
    new "Tenho evitado seu corredor desde aquele dia. Você sabe por quê."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3073
    old "The image is burned into my brain. I can't unsee it."
    new "A imagem ficou gravada no meu cérebro. Não consigo desver."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3073
    old "Please just lock your door from now on. For both our sakes."
    new "Por favor, só tranca a porta de agora em diante. Pelo bem de nós dois."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3073
    old "I knocked! I swear I knocked!"
    new "Eu bati! Juro que bati!"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3080
    old "I caught a glimpse when I walked by your room. Nice moves."
    new "Vi de relance quando passei pelo seu quarto. Bons movimentos."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3080
    old "Your room, huh? At least you keep it behind closed doors. Mostly."
    new "Seu quarto, hein? Pelo menos mantém a portas fechadas. Quase sempre."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3080
    old "I wasn't snooping. The door was open. Not my fault I have eyes."
    new "Eu não estava bisbilhotando. A porta estava aberta. Não é minha culpa que tenho olhos."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3086
    old "Looked like fun. Maybe I should swing by more often."
    new "Parecia divertido. Talvez eu devesse passar por lá mais vezes."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3086
    old "Don't worry, your secret is safe with me. I've got my own."
    new "Não se preocupe, seu segredo está seguro comigo. Eu tenho os meus."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3093
    old "I accidentally walked in on you in your room. I'm still recovering."
    new "Acidentalmente entrei no seu quarto. Ainda estou me recuperando."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3093
    old "Your door wasn't fully closed and I saw way more than I wanted to."
    new "Sua porta não estava totalmente fechada e eu vi muito mais do que queria."

